# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify _headers file.
#
# NOT IN USE AND STALE — do not trust the CSP below. tefillah.in is served from
# S3 + CloudFront, and deploy-web.sh uploads with `--exclude '_headers'`, so this
# file never reaches production. The live policy is set on the CloudFront
# distribution (E20DJ1IDF5M5MD) and is much wider than this one: it has to allow
# identitytoolkit / securetoken / firebaseapp.com for Google and Apple sign-in,
# none of which appear here. Kept only as a starting point if the site ever moves
# to a host that reads this file — in which case sync it against the live header
# first (`curl -I https://tefillah.in/login`) or sign-in will break.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(self), payment=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob:; connect-src 'self' https://api.tefillah.in; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'

# Cache hashed asset bundles for a year.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
